      "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description": "Contains identifiers of cohesin-related chromatin loops from CohesinDB. CohesinDB includes 2043 epigenomics, transcriptomics and 3D genomics datasets from 530 studies involving 176 cell types. Each identifier represents a single cohesin-related chromatin loop. Each cohesin object is annotated with locus, cell type, classification, function, 3D genomics and cis-regulatory information.",
