      "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description": "The primary goal of this ontology is to standardize the representation of molecular simulation data, processes, and methodologies across disparate simulation platforms, engines (e.g., GROMACS, AMBER, NAMD), and analysis tools, while ensuring these terms are interoperable with existing life sciences ontologies",
