      "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description": "ProbOnto, is an ontology-based knowledge base of probability distributions, featuring uni- and multivariate distributions with their defining functions, characteristics, relationships and reparameterisation formulae.  It can be used for annotation of models, facilitating the encoding of distribution-based models, related functions and quantities.",
      "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf": {
