      "http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description": {
        "@value": "A placeholder collection of ontologies, controlled vocabularies, and schemas relevant for the PUNCH4NFDI Consortium created by the [NFDI Section Metadata WG Ontology Harmonization and Mapping](https://github.com/nfdi-de/section-metadata-wg-onto/). The working group is in the process of identifying PUNCH4NFDI Consortium members appropriate for maintaining this collection. PUNCH4NFDI is notable in that its sub-disciplines (e.g., astronomy, high energy physics, nuclear physics, etc.) have a large variety in data and metadata needs."
