      "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description": "CCSO is an educational ontology acting as a data model for concepts and entities within an academic setting, enabling also the annotation of potentially available resources. The ontology aims to conceptualize educational entities within Curriculum and Syllabus with appropriate coverage and quality, in order to support rich services on top for improving curriculum management and automatically enabling syllabus semantic processes. (from homepage)",
