      "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description": "An ontology with predicates to formalization of the concept of mentions. The mentions may be either explicit (e.g. as when well stated into an article \"Dr. Johnson's groundbreaking research on climate change\") or implicit (e.g. such as discussing \"seminal studies in the field\"). MiTO contains the object property mito:mentions and its inverse mito:isMentionedBy.",
